# Inferred [do] with Error value — and-then short-circuits on Error
# [do [x: [Error "fail"]] [Ok x]] → result.bind [Error "fail"] [fn [x] [Ok x]]
# → and-then [fn [x] [Ok x]] [Error "fail"] → [Error "fail"] (short-circuit).
[do [x: [Error "fail"]] [Ok x]]
=== out
Variant(Result.Error, Dict({"msg": String("fail")}))
